Package: wg-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: wg-agent maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: wireguard-tools, libc6 (>= 2.34)
Homepage: https://github.com/VinhNguyenV/wg-agent
Description: WireGuard control plane agent for one Linux node
 Manages the WireGuard interfaces of one node through wg and wg-quick, from a
 CLI on the node and a REST API behind one bearer token. It creates interfaces,
 adds and removes peers, hands a client its configuration and reports status.
